### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
@projectId = 123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000

### 1. Registro de usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuario Test",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 2. Login de usuario
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###

### 3. Crear Workspace
POST {{baseUrl}}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mi Espacio de Trabajo"
}

###

### 4. Crear una Tarea
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project_id": "{{projectId}}",
  "title": "Implementar especificación Spec-Kit",
  "description": "Completar la especificación del Integrante 1",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

###

### 5. Obtener Tareas del Proyecto
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?status=TODO
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 6. Añadir un comentario a la tarea
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.id}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Revisar los contratos OpenAPI antes de enviar al Integrante 2"
}